### Defining the Domain & Testing it

- Entities have an ID that allows we to tell them apart.Their properties can change, but the ID always remains the same.

- Value objects describe some aspect of an entity. They don't have IDs, and if change of their properties, we create a new value object.For this reason, they should always be immutable.

- Separating the Domain from the Infrastructure (Hub interface, Plug the hub into app)

